{"4962770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lobotomy", "steam_appid": 4962770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Say with Certainty That You Are Sane?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is mental illness? And who decides who is a patient... and who is truly sane?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients while uncovering the dark secrets hidden within the hospital. But the closer you get to the truth, the more your own sanity begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While working as a nurse, you come across a news report about a brutal psychiatric hospital where lobotomies are secretly performed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you dismiss it as just another disturbing story and continue your daily routine. But before long, the patients begin telling you strange, unsettling tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories that should exist only in novels are now unfolding before your very eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the things you are witnessing... truly real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/0ff55097054d78dd13925b77d8384f8c.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/0ff55097054d78dd13925b77d8384f8c.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of locations, including patient wards, examination rooms, the morgue, and operating theaters, as you search for clues behind the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital's darkest secrets are hidden within the traces left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.webm?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and analyze patient charts, medical records, notes, and documents to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/6d77d14ade923ca20c11bc0c80e1902d.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/6d77d14ade923ca20c11bc0c80e1902d.webm?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/6d77d14ade923ca20c11bc0c80e1902d.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully to what the patients have to say—your survival may depend on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar gradually becomes unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And things that should never exist begin to appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an immersive psychiatric hospital</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story by collecting documents and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the blurred line between reality and illusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design that heightens tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror that challenges the player's perception</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The patients insist that something is terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medical staff insist that everything is perfectly normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who is telling the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/9a5595bb5a9911c81fdfadbca1115d5f.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/9a5595bb5a9911c81fdfadbca1115d5f.webm?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/9a5595bb5a9911c81fdfadbca1115d5f.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Say with Certainty That You Are Sane?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is mental illness? And who decides who is a patient... and who is truly sane?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients while uncovering the dark secrets hidden within the hospital. But the closer you get to the truth, the more your own sanity begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While working as a nurse, you come across a news report about a brutal psychiatric hospital where lobotomies are secretly performed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you dismiss it as just another disturbing story and continue your daily routine. But before long, the patients begin telling you strange, unsettling tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories that should exist only in novels are now unfolding before your very eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the things you are witnessing... truly real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/0ff55097054d78dd13925b77d8384f8c.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/0ff55097054d78dd13925b77d8384f8c.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of locations, including patient wards, examination rooms, the morgue, and operating theaters, as you search for clues behind the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital's darkest secrets are hidden within the traces left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.poster.avif?t=1786446777\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.webm?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962770/extras/5d2a656a75ebcd1b4ae3815ee7880add.mp4?t=1786446777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and analyze patient charts, medical records, notes, and documents to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas